cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below. The data is © OpenStreetMap contributors (ODbL-1.0)."
type: dataset
title: "dz-geodata: Algeria's administrative boundaries (wilayas, daïras, communes) as GeoJSON/TopoJSON"
abstract: >-
  Algeria's 69 wilayas, 548 daïras and 1,538 communes as GeoJSON and TopoJSON
  with Arabic, French and English names, ONS commune codes and the hierarchy
  between levels, built reproducibly from OpenStreetMap, with npm and Python
  lookup packages.
authors:
  - family-names: Chougui
    given-names: Abdeldjalil
version: 0.1.1
license:
  - ODbL-1.0
  - MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/AbdeldjalilChougui/dz-geodata"
url: "https://github.com/AbdeldjalilChougui/dz-geodata"
keywords:
  - Algeria
  - administrative boundaries
  - GeoJSON
  - TopoJSON
  - OpenStreetMap
